{"3852900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Weaver", "steam_appid": 3852900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《The Weaver》 is an action RPG inspired by the Eastern philosophy of the Five Elements (Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, Water).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By entering your birthdate, you are granted one of these elemental powers and become an exorcist who fights off evil spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smart Combat Using Five Elements and Their Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, the powers of Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, and Water exist.<br>Each element can either support or counter the others.<br>By learning how these elements interact, you can gain the upper hand in battle.<br>Gradually discover which element benefits you—or puts you at a disadvantage—and craft your own strategic playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/extras/a434942c2ae463e58131cd13a0e7ecb7.poster.avif?t=1781103243\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/extras/a434942c2ae463e58131cd13a0e7ecb7.webm?t=1781103243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/extras/a434942c2ae463e58131cd13a0e7ecb7.mp4?t=1781103243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tension-Filled Physical Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overwhelm your enemies with skill-based combo attacks, precise dodges, and sharp parries.<br>No matter how strong your opponent is, your agility will keep you one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/extras/cf96d8074b5ccfb28fd16f080fa99da3.poster.avif?t=1781103243\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/extras/cf96d8074b5ccfb28fd16f080fa99da3.webm?t=1781103243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/extras/cf96d8074b5ccfb28fd16f080fa99da3.mp4?t=1781103243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《The Weaver》 is an action RPG inspired by the Eastern philosophy of the Five Elements (Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, Water).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By entering your birthdate, you are granted one of these elemental powers and become an exorcist who fights off evil spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Smart Combat Using Five Elements and Their Interactions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, the powers of Wood, Fire, Earth, Metal, and Water exist.<br>Each element can either support or counter the others.<br>By learning how these elements interact, you can gain the upper hand in battle.<br>Gradually discover which element benefits you—or puts you at a disadvantage—and craft your own strategic playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/extras/a434942c2ae463e58131cd13a0e7ecb7.poster.avif?t=1781103243\" width=800 height=446 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/extras/a434942c2ae463e58131cd13a0e7ecb7.webm?t=1781103243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/extras/a434942c2ae463e58131cd13a0e7ecb7.mp4?t=1781103243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tension-Filled Physical Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overwhelm your enemies with skill-based combo attacks, precise dodges, and sharp parries.<br>No matter how strong your opponent is, your agility will keep you one step ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/extras/cf96d8074b5ccfb28fd16f080fa99da3.poster.avif?t=1781103243\" width=800 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/extras/cf96d8074b5ccfb28fd16f080fa99da3.webm?t=1781103243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/extras/cf96d8074b5ccfb28fd16f080fa99da3.mp4?t=1781103243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "This Action RPG shapes your abilities using your elemental birth chart. Join the Fate Council, guardians of world order, and purify corrupted spirits. Destiny guides your way—but what awaits at journey’s end remains unknown.", "supported_languages": "Korean, English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/cff77244cf1271e206706316d2fdf793cb03789b/header.jpg?t=1781103243", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/19990de9fb20175c292a8ad86c358fc4845fe725/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781103243", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3852900/19990de9fb20175c292a8ad86c358fc4845fe725/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781103243", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li